          "cites": [
            "s9"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Pricing",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "Pricing is a major concern at $65 a seat.",
          "origin": "you",
          "cites": [
            "s10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They need year one under $90K and are open to a two-year term.",
          "origin": "you",
          "cites": [
            "s12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dana expects the CFO to push back on the larger spend.",
          "origin": "ai",
          "cites": [
            "s10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A multi-year term should lower the per-seat price.",
          "origin": "ai",
          "cites": [
            "s11"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Security & procurement",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "Security review is required with Marcus, and they need SOC 2 and Okta SSO.",
          "origin": "you",
          "cites": [
            "s14",
            "s16"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marcus is the new CISO overseeing the formal vendor review.",
