          "cites": [
            "s14"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You offered the SOC 2 Type II report and a completed security questionnaire.",
          "origin": "ai",
          "cites": [
            "s15"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "SSO through Okta is required before rollout and is included on the growth tier.",
          "origin": "ai",
          "cites": [
            "s16",
            "s17"
